    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nYou're a QA Engineer at PetPal, a pet care app. Your manager just messaged you:\r\n\r\n> \"Three bugs came in overnight on the pet stats feature. Take a look, figure out which one's worst, and fix them in that order. Track your work in triage.md.\"\r\n\r\n1. Open `triage.md`. Click each button and observe how the pet's stats change. For each bug you find, note what happened and rate the severity (high, medium, low).\r\n\r\n2. Based on your notes, decide what order to fix the bugs in.\r\n\r\n3. For each bug, write your best guess: which variable is wrong, and what do you think the bug is? Then share your observation and your guess with AI Tutor and ask for help finding and fixing it.\r\n\r\n4. Fix the code in `script.js` and test again until all three buttons work as expected.",
    "display_name": "Pet Care Simulator",
